{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1458,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb0fc0cab9327c0b7566527",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有让你留下回忆吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7117ebf7426dd2fef35dad29548eedf63099cea0bc627c58f5bc117b06b51ff4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86e83a298e3c2cd83577deef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请别忘记这份甜甜的回忆哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3117dbcdcf026bdf79c3f61e88f649b26c952c80c176cdc211d23a8c2ee65c25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7852d2dfc8aa0ab08454ab86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正火热的软萌Q弹小真，登场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7e18e7c1af3207275fa812ae9dfc68420387b7c729167c33ff5ccebbb9c5a16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2c861d0de507ccdce15d503",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "会一些小才艺的全方位艺人，\r\n才比较容易受人喜爱嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79a2dc89a3a97940c8d31a6971ece7ece755779ebe2372cf1b253007e41352f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0c85178f94353f2ff87b19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵～请看。\r\n小真又变得更美丽了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2de8879ec4d010424d2ff6301daa3e72674904ef4a3ff33247ab46783de4308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37365d0216bb081fe986e735",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是真弓快车。\r\n……请多指教啰。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f24812c05c4438a8caee5e0a7dbb6ce79cb33bf584364d02b998523cd8fe838",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2bd9ebda20c71f37968df36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫真弓快车，\r\n是赛马娘……要好好记住喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ebad72d4b067aa20b76d632da1c72fa95bee9d488eda5de1779a2f9e7f942a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a6f2df028b65f3b516a36cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力替大家加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e3fac8883b37f2f20026843648b777a88702a9d98f61421b5676af113b3045b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ceb0a5b637425113d3f390c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "策画方面就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0a7ecc95641fe2ac9cfa4968adbed6e6ee221dd2a99c94b49b5fb35d1cb553",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:975c2adb138d8a78c0ebcb87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同比提升，软萌Q弹感Up～\r\n现已实现~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0473afc0907e77532263992bba03b8c37120f53e5bba361ed7bf161b652b69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5a82a8dc1238929c9f212c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "甜点的多样性也得增加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70a5e943437138d6b9762f1b072497bfb70ce5a36d6a2af4379dd72030ef533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f6600f34f7ff34e32fb339a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "软萌Q弹小真，\r\n现在正是推销自己的时刻！",
      "source_fingerprint": "915ef1f7e269d4d09934c8d7779df0663838107192816ac6d9a6ade46b226492",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e031f1fe5df1198a085951f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是真弓快车♪\r\n一起来创造甜甜的回忆吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d61431c0d43398530db1529fe162fbfc7effa736d930ae50c42c164f826367cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1087",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:264cc438add34fc105b5a845",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14c574a9367b75f23f1cc25a265f9ff7951a2bab238c0f41c73d33cc7496abc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20658c805ea9a8d103c39562",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论什么样的逆境我都会克服给你看。\n将你的信任与热情，\n化作助我前行的顺风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ffd6ac812c8ebe33200fff8a341ad549b54b0b97a766a1b924a8c575e16ca3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbfa121296cec4951a395fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8460d3b2b8d4ce03e5afc963",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6751dfe306ea79492d45848f61a94cb9c4ec83cec4d271d8b9dfd75cb5796c29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d3a0d7103c5489118da2a3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今以后，我会好好地\n把重要的事情用语言传达出来。\n……为了能与重要的人并肩前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "313e54e26f746e7244f2f5f34d0e1065db3f07041ea605ff836cd49d9a330112",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7efe3bbcdb7855aac0b61e4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在香港如果有想做的事，\n请尽管告诉我哦。我会尽量\n安排进计划里的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00054bd4c675d0b0f63aee03968e1d6c02aead09da1655dd4e9285ada8005e73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56cfa7d4f3e4c6bc7aa8388d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快樂！今年也有很多\n想做的事情。首先必须从\n制定计划开始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "971040933ed444db9688ec2ba85b2a4938bf3b2207ba29d544708182f69db692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f2ea21a14aad7b24ee86c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy Valentine's Day!\n希望能度过愉快的一天。\n首先，要不要一起喝个茶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2559a5bc783b568291f3947c2e53e61b8beddbf9457dcfa49ce60f7b5125bd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7de1197c1ebdd4053e05be2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能让大家玩得开心，我做了\n什锦点心盒！喜欢的口味，\n请尽情品尝吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e4af569debcb837bc0c3b75a7841cf07f6996eedec46adfd449ee8fd2b1caa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c357f11143726ba4362f2f1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果是我的话，无论天气如何\n都一定会横跨银河给你看。\n以让所有人都惊叹的、完美的方式！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ee6130ba5158c19d87f7fbf5aa3b7b4b7052527223483de5674a69e718206a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc257b09e047915c96e503af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "萬聖節快樂！带好糖果了吗？\n大家那充满期待的脸庞，\n真想让他们的笑容更加灿烂呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f22c978adae979e9e610e882073462df03646ad6896b06dac82e8d54469278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb8bc16eed3162d034e5ba28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞商战的准备已经万无一失了。\n接下来只要满心期待地\n等待今日的结果就行了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "143d0664de698d21a61895c2f08280144aee2fd0c007b739fe6b6ae9a9490956",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9819332df36e71d8347f0dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真漂亮啊。无论是灯饰、\n圣诞树，还是大家的笑容……呵呵，\n今天似乎能悠闲地度过呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0202505a466d07fb77a2bf911ae0fefd6cb9218efcee7d0cffef7d2b4e90dc97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85019e3b0698795a29e32e33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49672a086a169b187b16a389c63cf25fceada147d32b3aa866520c2b922fd86c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e209b4a4e06c4c463c7148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "确认事项检查完毕，\n联络也全部回复了……嗯，\n应该没有漏掉的事情了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7c6595685d72f40f9b56ad6af53e8dd68ec3830e08944fcb59a7dc8ceac553f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41fe9b5d33e2cc432b2bb3e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快樂呀！我已经准备好了\n蛋糕和饮料，\n待会儿尽情享受吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b59b7e00620f49e12f885314bef78ce0d97df9a10f0f21c32381bf82c33e8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13ba1221d0824ae0dd9b650a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今天起又是新的人生了呢♪\n有什么目标吗？只要是我能办到的，\n我会全力协助你的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a219e8dbc7c33d8e0ef99dccddbb086a856d5b8fb3bdf18878a28572eb01d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7f9821965f7302e0802b4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然今天是特别的日子，但要做的事\n并不会改变。全力向前迈进，\n仅此而已！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a1d39f3827d88f0bd7c141300d95a34976b90c81d87ba7cfa463a9d9309890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8ce7c5dcd9a6df474d81ea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……礼物？哎呀，真不好意思，\n让你费心了。不过我很开心。\n现在可以在这里拆开吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c08ef92ad2c5c28467ac03eb18adb9f5edcbe7bd0bb8988bad8de228bab9d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804fbc22b2c95c62ac45a32c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新通知。\n必须仔细检查一下才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c3518cd8e4400ef02cf01cb77cd3541bf124b62626ce07d8419f38b9df2ba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53867c0409a8119483c6cb3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了哦！\n可以一起看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcd1c205bfed768cf25b9bc04a91ebdd9facdce799744089f50c5e835494b0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:279eb4b2cfd33d81142b0daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成了。\n你挺干练的嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f22a760a37774807cd8c62131eca8cfaed586d89ecf204b153930ce198b95a8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6c2f0a8d32c44b4a90f1690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎快要开始了。\n嗅到了新商机的气息呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48d9f4e47cdaedd82389e1a1f99fd7d72d8be42d1dcc0dd62cc30783ec1ad4e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e4c9b1bd61d6894c1e0b0ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了！\n准备好享受其中了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c6059db5eba62d12aa66e6e333452d6a6192c71e0a10c82425c66471984342",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9befe80699602f49d29d3665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换一下心情吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60325510a74b32fca744cfb6121bde52364195975c7addd4a63d22452232b9f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5776c1411055ea43c75a9efa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了！\n太厉害了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f69642e69310a40ab1dfae0f538b8c7b485b252c081df1d0a928beb01efcc165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aa97057484a8371d8a6b678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我时刻都会选择最合适的着装。\n在商务场合，外表给人的\n真诚感会直接关系到信任。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b9c767c6cfa830f166f77c4f1aea310f3a3a9c1ad8a9302edc2f1e63f50760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7982de86b47286ea8c042e7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套当然是在父亲的公司\n定制的。设计和\n面料全都是由我亲自构思的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4219da4e18d5da3a3d45c6779c57d9a97b0122751ac7d6964bd2348cff498d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891f14e07c59af38fa309fc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受母亲和姐姐的影响，穿上高跟鞋\n曾是我的梦想呢♪我想现在我\n已经能完美驾驭它了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53658f40797d12142dccdd05cdd4db99586c59d471457d90550ea9b7871a3ae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e70d4eb92ba0ee42ec19d7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不愧是你……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8def1032c58d90b127d488c9a14ca778dee317bc2d3fc9dc8891b3a84bc3564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f039d4afd8f52d9e0c6cc0d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "1004"
